      "title": "Introducing ElevenLabs' Generative Voice AI",
      "sourceHash": "1a038342639c8f01bd7925fc618cc99889f49be9461f420af9863ad873503378",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "We saw that text to image AI tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.5,
          "en": "can provide amazing results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 10.71,
          "en": "Now we'll have a look at text-to-speech AI tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.71,
          "end": 13.323,
          "en": "or at generative voice AI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 17.79,
          "en": "This simply means that you have a text of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.79,
          "end": 20.37,
          "en": "and then you decide who should be the speaker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.37,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "to read this text out loud",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.37,
          "en": "and the speaker can be a random voice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.37,
          "end": 29.46,
          "en": "but this can also be your own voice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.46,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "This sounds very interesting, I think.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 33.619,
          "en": "Therefore, we also want to show you one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.619,
          "end": 37.38,
          "en": "of these text-to-speech AI tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.38,
          "end": 40.11,
          "en": "There are many tools available on the market.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.11,
          "end": 42.84,
          "en": "We decided to choose one of the most popular",
          "zh": ""
        },
