          "end": 79.533,
          "en": "So which AI model is used to generate the voice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 83.763,
          "en": "Then we have to enter the text that should be read out loud.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.84,
          "end": 87.963,
          "en": "And finally, we have to generate the audio file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
